---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../data/site.config';

const updated = 'June 22, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="AIViewer.ai privacy policy, including analytics, advertising cookies, Google AdSense disclosures, and user choices."
>
  <Header />

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-200/70 bg-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-[var(--color-bg)]">
    <div class="page-container py-12 md:py-16">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-600 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-400">
          Legal
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          This page explains what AIViewer.ai collects, how we use it, and how advertising and analytics partners may use cookies.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-400">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[var(--color-bg)]">
    <div class="page-container py-12 md:py-16">
      <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-7 leading-8 text-zinc-600 shadow-[var(--shadow-card)] dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 md:p-9" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          AIViewer.ai is an editorial website. We may collect basic technical information such as pages viewed, approximate location, browser type, device type, referring pages, and interaction events. If you contact us or subscribe to a newsletter, we collect the information you choose to provide, such as your email address and message.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">How We Use Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We use information to operate the site, understand which content is useful, improve navigation and performance, respond to messages, prevent abuse, and support advertising or sponsorship programs.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Google AdSense and Advertising Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables Google and its partners to serve ads based on visits to AIViewer.ai and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-indigo-400">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also learn about choices for other participating ad networks at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-indigo-400">aboutads.info</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If we work with additional ad networks, those vendors may also use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads and measure performance. We will keep this policy updated as our monetization partners change.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We may use privacy-conscious analytics tools to measure page views, performance, and general engagement. Analytics data helps us improve content quality and site usability.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Affiliate Links and Sponsorships</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Some links may be affiliate or sponsored links. If you click one and make a purchase, AIViewer.ai may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Sponsored or affiliate relationships do not guarantee positive coverage.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Your Choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          You can control cookies through your browser settings. You may unsubscribe from email updates using the link in the email or by contacting us. You may also contact us to ask about information you provided directly.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-9 text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          For privacy questions, contact <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.monetization.contactEmail}`} class="font-medium text-indigo-600 underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-indigo-400">{siteConfig.monetization.contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
